{"product_id":"mummies-in-the-morning-magic-tree-house-no-3","title":"Mummies in the Morning (Magic Tree House, No. 3)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe #1 bestselling chapter book series of all time celebrates 25 years with new covers and a new, easy-to-use numbering system!Jack and Annie don't need another mummy. But that's what they get when the Magic Tree House whisks them back to ancient Egypt. There they meet a long-dead queen who needs their help. Will Jack and Annie be able to solve the puzzle, or will they end up as mummies themselves?Did you know that there’s a Magic Tree House book for every kid?Magic Tree House: Adventures with Jack and Annie, perfect for readers who are just beginning chapter booksMerlin Missions: More challenging adventures for the experienced readerSuper Edition: A longer and more dangerous adventureFact Trackers: Nonfiction companions to your favorite Magic Tree House adventures\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 132 x 194\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Mary Pope Osborne\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780679824244\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 80\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45898400465049,"sku":"17RE-2-9780679824244","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/691822ca75ff5_Mummies_in_the_Morning__Magic_Tree_House__No._3.jpg?v=1763202663","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/mummies-in-the-morning-magic-tree-house-no-3","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}